#. i18n: file kspread_insertcalendardialogbase.ui line 16
#: kspread_plugininsertcalendar.cc:88 rc.cpp:6
#, no-c-format
msgid "Insert Calendar"
msgstr "Kalenner infögen"

#. i18n: file kspread_insertcalendardialogbase.ui line 22
#: rc.cpp:9
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Insert Calendar dialog lets you set the dates of the calendar you want to "
"insert. When you have choosen the desired dates, simply press the Insert button "
"to insert the calendar into the spreadsheet, starting at the cell you have "
"currently selected."
msgstr ""
"Mit den Dialoog \"Kalenner infögen\" laat sik de Daten vun den Kalenner "
"instellen, de inföögt warrn schall. Wenn Du de Daten utsöcht hest, klick "
"eenfach op den Knoop \"Infögen\". So warrt de Kalenner vun de aktuell utsöcht "
"Zell af na't Arbeitblatt inföögt."

#. i18n: file kspread_insertcalendardialogbase.ui line 34
#: rc.cpp:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "Start Date"
msgstr "Anfangdatum"

#. i18n: file kspread_insertcalendardialogbase.ui line 37
#: rc.cpp:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "Set the start date of the calendar you want to insert."
msgstr "Startdatum vun den Kalenner fastleggen, de inföögt warrn schall."

#. i18n: file kspread_insertcalendardialogbase.ui line 40
#: rc.cpp:18
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can choose on which date your calendar should start. The selected date "
"will be the first day of the inserted calendar. You can also choose a date from "
"a calendar dialog by pressing Select Date."
msgstr ""
"Hier lett sik den Kalenner sien Anfangdatum utsöken. Dat utsöcht Datum is de "
"eerst Dag vun den inföögt Kalenner. Een kann dat Datum ok binnen den "
"Kalenner-Dialoog mit den Knoop \"Datum-Utwahl\" utsöken."

#. i18n: file kspread_insertcalendardialogbase.ui line 72
#: rc.cpp:21 rc.cpp:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "Date Picker"
msgstr "Datum-Utwahl"

#. i18n: file kspread_insertcalendardialogbase.ui line 75
#: rc.cpp:24 rc.cpp:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use a graphical date picker to select a date."
msgstr "Graafsch Datum-Utwahl bruken."

#. i18n: file kspread_insertcalendardialogbase.ui line 91
#: rc.cpp:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "End Date"
msgstr "Enndatum"

#. i18n: file kspread_insertcalendardialogbase.ui line 94
#: rc.cpp:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Set the end date of the calendar you want to insert."
msgstr "Enndatum vun den Kalenner fastleggen, de inföögt warrn schall."

#. i18n: file kspread_insertcalendardialogbase.ui line 97
#: rc.cpp:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can choose on which date your calendar should end. The selected date "
"will be the last day of the inserted calendar. You can also choose a date from "
"a calendar dialog by pressing Select Date."
msgstr ""
"Hier lett sik den Kalenner sien Enndatum utsöken. Dat utsöcht Datum is de lest "
"Dag vun den inföögt Kalenner. Een kann dat Datum ok binnen den Kalenner-Dialoog "
"mit den Knoop\"Datum-Utwahl\" utsöken."

#. i18n: file kspread_insertcalendardialogbase.ui line 170
#: rc.cpp:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "Insert the calendar at the currently selected cell."
msgstr "Den Kalenner na de aktuell utsöcht Zell infögen."

#. i18n: file kspread_insertcalendardialogbase.ui line 174
#: rc.cpp:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A new calendar will be inserted starting at the currently selected cell."
msgstr "En nieg Kalenner warrt vun de aktuell utsöcht Zell af inföögt."

#. i18n: file kspread_insertcalendardialogbase.ui line 194
#: rc.cpp:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "Don't insert a calendar."
msgstr "Keen Kalenner infögen."

#. i18n: file kspread_insertcalendardialogbase.ui line 197
#: rc.cpp:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Quits the dialog and does not insert a calendar. Use this to cancel this "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"Beendt den Dialoog un föögt keen Kalenner in. Bruuk dit, wenn Du disse Akschoon "
"afbreken wullt."

#: kspread_plugininsertcalendar.cc:76
msgid "Insert Calendar..."
msgstr "Kalenner infögen..."

#: kspread_plugininsertcalendar.cc:90
msgid "KSpread Insert Calendar Plugin"
msgstr "Kalenner-Inföögmoduul för KSpread"

#: kspread_plugininsertcalendar.cc:92
msgid "(c) 2005, The KSpread Team"
msgstr "(c) 2005, de Schrieverslüüd vun KSpread"

#: kspread_plugininsertcalendar.cc:129
msgid "Can't insert calendar because no document is set!"
msgstr "Kalenner lett sik nich infögen, wiel keen Dokment fastleggt weer!"

#: kspread_plugininsertcalendar.cc:135
msgid ""
"End date is before start date! Please make sure that end date comes after start "
"date."
msgstr ""
"Enndatum is fröher as dat Startdatum! Dat Enndatum mutt later as dat Startdatum "
"wesen."

#: kspread_plugininsertcalendar.cc:141
msgid ""
"Calendars shouldn't be longer than 10 years. If you really need such long "
"periods you need to split them up."
msgstr ""
"Kalenners schöölt nich länger as teihn Johren wesen. Wenn so lang Tietrüüm "
"bruukt warrt, mööt se opdeelt warrn."

#: kspread_plugininsertcalendar.cc:147
msgid ""
"Start and end dates are equal! Only one day will be inserted, do you want to "
"continue?"
msgstr ""
"Start- un Enndatum sünd liek! Bloots een Dag warrt inföögt. Wullt Du "
"wiedermaken?"

#: kspread_plugininsertcalendar.cc:153
msgid ""
"Creating a calendar for a longer period than a year can take up a lot of space, "
"do you want to continue?"
msgstr ""
"Dat Opstellen vun en Kalenner de länger as een Johr is, kann veel Spiekerplatz "
"bruken. Wullt Du wiedermaken?"

#: kspread_plugininsertcalendar.cc:180
msgid ""
"The area where the calendar is inserted is NOT empty, are you sure you want to "
"continue, overwriting existing data? If you choose No the area that would be "
"required for the desired calendar will be selected so you can see what data "
"would be overwritten."
msgstr ""
"Dat Rebeet, binnen dat de Kalenner inföögt warrn schall, is NICH leddig. Wullt "
"Du redig wiedermaken un de al vörhannen Daten överschrieven? Wenn Du \"Nee\" "
"anklickst, warrt dat för den Kalenner bruukt Rebeet markeert, so dat Du Di de "
"Daten ankieken kannst, de överschreven wöörn."

#: kspread_plugininsertcalendar.cc:197
msgid "Calendar from %1 to %2"
msgstr "Kalenner vun %1 bet %2"

#: kspread_plugininsertcalendar.cc:244
msgid "week"
msgstr "Week"

